        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Grey corded silk bow tie with pre-formed knot. This is hand-stitched and has a collar attachment of Japanned brass, and a steel spike that serves to keep the tie taught. The free end of the tie has a sheet metal stiffener. The seams are finished with machine-sewn chain stitch in cream cotton."@en ;
